When you switch it on, does one of the leds on the front panel light
up?
I read your description as follows:
You switch on the system and all you see is a rotating fan, right?

A few new questions:
1) Do you have a console terminal attached to the system?
2) Do you have a VGA monitor and pc type mouse and keyboard attached?
If only the answer to question 2) is yes, do try to connect a VT100
terminal or a pc with a VT100 emulator and a serial port to the serial
console port of the AS400.
Hit enter a feew times and see whether you get a >>> prompt.
Hans


